<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1673297764"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:16.224"><div begin="16.929" end="40.929" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="16.929" end="21.250" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.929" end="17.182">得</span><span begin="17.182" end="17.396">到</span><span begin="17.396" end="17.762">一</span><span begin="17.762" end="18.031">刻</span><span begin="18.031" end="19.583">开心过后</span> <span begin="19.725" end="20.217">不</span><span begin="20.217" end="20.417">开</span><span begin="20.417" end="21.250">心</span></p><p begin="21.659" end="27.573" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.659" end="22.502">怎么</span><span begin="22.502" end="22.816">都</span><span begin="22.816" end="23.420">不</span><span begin="23.420" end="23.669">开</span><span begin="23.669" end="24.330">心</span> <span begin="24.955" end="25.788">谁责</span><span begin="25.788" end="27.573">任</span></p><p begin="29.651" end="33.953" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.651" end="30.174">拖拖</span><span begin="30.174" end="30.598">拉</span><span begin="30.598" end="30.760">拉</span><span begin="30.760" end="32.349">最后还是</span> <span begin="32.583" end="32.952">不</span><span begin="32.952" end="33.152">发</span><span begin="33.152" end="33.953">奋</span></p><p begin="34.460" end="40.929" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.460" end="35.364">永远</span><span begin="35.364" end="36.154">看</span><span begin="36.154" end="36.372">不</span><span begin="36.372" end="36.897">见</span><span begin="36.897" end="37.207">未</span><span begin="37.207" end="37.623">来</span> <span begin="37.761" end="38.590">被爱</span><span begin="38.590" end="39.381">软</span><span begin="39.381" end="40.929">禁</span></p></div><div begin="43.689" end="1:07.424" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="43.689" end="49.341" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.689" end="45.308">矛盾只因</span><span begin="45.308" end="45.626">深</span><span begin="45.626" end="46.010">爱</span><span begin="46.